### 5.1 Found in the automation runs (open) — Workflow gaps found end to end
- [ ] **(Eng)** Facility address: the watcher reminds the supplier about the goods-ready date, but there is no reminder for a missing facility address (`facility_address_request` is sent once). Add a reminder and a stall exception.
- [ ] **(Eng/QA)** Standby supplier switch (UC-13 / UC-14): a standby supplier from a scan has only a town, so its inspection now waits for an address — re-run both journeys and confirm the request goes to the new supplier.
- [ ] **(Eng)** Cross-prospect offers: the match board pairs a buyer with supplier offers from other deals of the same HS code, including old ones. Confirm `MATCH_OFFER_VALIDITY_DAYS` expiry is enough, and never propose an offer from a CANCELLED / failed deal without a fresh price.
- [ ] **(Eng)** Negotiation drafts still sometimes say things like "As soon as we have the inspector selected, we will send the proforma invoice" — review a sample of real drafts each week (stage wording, missing-information order).

