### 11.2 Cut costs on every shipment — New features to raise profit per deal (product)
- [ ] **(Eng)** **Freight quotes from more than one source** (Maersk + forwarders) and book the cheapest that meets the date; today Maersk is booked by default.
- [ ] **(Eng)** **Container fill**: maximise MT per container (20 ft vs 40 ft, bag weight) in the cost sheet and the offer quantity.
- [ ] **(Eng)** **Inspection cost**: compare inspector quotes per booking; offer the buyer a cheaper inspection plan when it is enough.
- [ ] **(Eng)** **Escrow provider by cost**: pick the cheaper provider per deal size when the buyer has no preference; pass the escrow fee to the buyer as a line item where allowed.

### 11.3 Price better — New features to raise profit per deal (product)
- [ ] **(Eng)** **Margin by corridor and buyer**: learn from accepted / countered indicative offers (outcomes already recorded) to set the target margin per HS code × market × buyer tier instead of one floor.
- [ ] **(Eng)** **Value-added services priced explicitly**: private label packing, fumigation, palletising, extra inspections — a markup per service, shown in the offer.

### 11.4 Win more and repeat — New features to raise profit per deal (product)
- [ ] **(Biz/Eng)** **Repeat orders and annual contracts**: a "reorder" button, reminders before the buyer's next usual order date, framework contracts with monthly lifts.
- [ ] **(Eng)** **Buyer scoring for outreach**: focus the funnel on buyers most likely to close (reply rate, import history, fit score) — less outreach cost per deal.
- [ ] **(Eng)** Funnel analytics: scans → prospects → interested → matched → PI → paid, with time and cost per step.

